WEBVTT

00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:31.919
Svi ćemo zajedno
dirigirati Straussovu skladbu.

00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:34.480
U redu? Svi je znate.

00:00:34.815 --> 00:00:36.377
U redu. Jeste li spremni?

00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:37.312
Publika: Da!

00:00:37.312 --> 00:00:39.888
Lotto: U redu.
Priprema, pozor, sad!

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:41.704
Samo kraj.

00:00:41.728 --> 00:00:45.697
(glazba: Richard Strauss,
"Tako je govorio Zarathustra")

00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:50.211
Zar ne?

00:00:50.235 --> 00:00:51.729
Znate kamo ovo vodi.

00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:56.871
(Glazba)